Domain Entity IDEAEvent
documentation "EARLY ACCESS: An IDEA related student event describing status, dates and narrative."
    domain entity Student
        documentation "A reference to the student."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "The identifier assigned to the education organization (usually District/LEA) providing IDEA Services."
        is part of identity
    shared string IdentificationCode named IDEAEventIdentifier
        documentation "	A unique identifier for the event record as assigned by the provider of IEP services."
        is part of identity
    descriptor IDEAEventType
        documentation "The specific legal step, procedure, or standard event milestone captured as part of IDEA compliance requirements."
        is part of identity
    date BeginDate
        documentation "The date when the IDEA related event started. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is required
    date EndDate
        documentation "The date when the IDEA related event concluded. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
        is optional
    descriptor EventCompliance
        documentation "The type of compliance represented by this event."
        is optional
    shared string TextResponse named EventNarrative
        documentation "Detailed and summary notes recorded during the event."
        is optional
    descriptor EventReason
        documentation "The reason why the IDEA event occurred."
        is optional
    